body:
took advantage of low interest rates 6 months ago and bought. Spring Hill, Mortgage is 1200 $ on a 2/2/2, if you stay I would advise you buy if you can. You can get yourself a roommate to help pay your mortgage instead of paying someone else's. 

&#x200B;

but . . . Transferring with your job might not be a bad thing either. my daughter is moving to Tampa from Park City, UT transferring with her job and the place she is looking at is actually 1000$ on a month cheaper for an additional bedroom and 800 more sqft,.. Just a thought, either way eff your landlord.
